      "source_text": "漫画中提及的『经典三观路线』。\n那是所有赛马娘都憧憬的，\n一生仅有一次的梦之舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdcedcea7b1e78c63c06e9af98f013c41cac19b7275339f58ee8f5b21d5ada90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
